request.description:
Update any fields of a payout method. Send only changed fields.

method_type CANNOT be changed.

**Example bodies:**
- Bank: {"account_number": "...", "routing_number": "..."}
- bKash: {"bkash_number": "01...", "bkash_account_holder_name": "..."}
- Nagad: {"nagad_number": "01...", "nagad_account_type": "PERSONAL"}

